/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// Objects cross to workers as copies: their methods run there, and changing a copy never changes the caller's object.
<>Point |
    x: 0
    y: 0
    act sum_xy()
        return self >> x + self >> y
    xx
xx
a <> Point | x: 1, y: 2
b <> Point | x: 3, y: 4
act measure(p)
    p >> x |= 100
    return p.sum_xy()
xx
say(:swarm([a, b], measure, 2))
say(a >> x)
